The '''Undead Catalyst''' is a {{Rare}} item that is an {{Odds|extraordinary}} drop from any {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}} that is {{SlayerTier|2}} or above. The Undead Catalyst is used in the crafting of the {{Item|Revenant Falchion}}. 

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
They player can obtain an '''Undead Catalyst''' as an {{O|e}} drop from a {{Stier|2}} or higher Revenant Horror. The player will receive 1 Undead Catalyst when collecting {{CollectionLink|Zombie Slayer|3}} rewards.

;Drop Chances
*{{Stier|2}}: {{Green|2.02%}}
*{{Stier|3}}: {{Green|2.01%}}
*{{Stier|4}}: {{Green|0.6%}}
*{{Stier|5}}: {{Green|1.69%}}

